	(text "The AXP192 with its rails, the 5 V boost to the M5-Bus, the USB-C input with its fuse, the reserved USB and\nbattery headers, the keys, the power LED, the vibration motor and the test points.\n\nMain parts: U4 AXP192, L2 L3, U8 SY7088, L4, J3 USB-C, FU1, J2, J5, S1 S2 keys, LED1, PAD2 motor, TP1-TP7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 48.26 0)
		(effects
