	)
	(text "Every part, pin and net of the Core2 v1.3 that the vendor's two published sheets show, with the\nvalues printed there: connectivity documented from the vendor's public documentation, with Kleidos\nadditions and corrections listed on page 1 (M5Stack's core sheet CORE2_V1.0_SCH, 2020-07-07, and\nexpansion sheet core2_v1.3_SCH, 2025-11-14, linked from the Core2 v1.3 docs page; README.md and\nnetlist.yaml beside this file cite them). Layout and symbols are this project's. No footprints, no\nPCB. Values are as printed (226/6.3V is 22 uF) except where an entry below corrects one. DNP marks a\npart not fitted. Designators are the vendor's; the expansion sheet reuses the core's, so its parts\nare +100 here (its U1 is U101). Nets the vendor left unnamed carry names of ours (AXP_LX1,\nRF_MATCH...). Zones: columns 1-8 and rows A-F, 50 mm apart, printed in the border."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 88.605 0)
		(effects
